[{"id":"ODk-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila <img alt=\"Cu(CN)_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Cu%28CN%29_%7B2%7D\" /> dipanaskan, dihasilkan <img alt=\"C_{2}N_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B2%7DN_%7B2%7D\" /> (sianogen) dan CuCN. Massa <img alt=\"Cu(CN)_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Cu%28CN%29_%7B2%7D\" /> yang<br /> dibutuhkan untuk membuat <img alt=\"C_{2}N_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B2%7DN_%7B2%7D\" /> sebanyak 5,00 g adalah<br />","choices":["20,2 g","22,2 g","24,2 g","26,4 g","28,6 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI1OA"},{"id":"ODk-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila persen hasil reaksi:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401155524.jpg\" style=\"height:22px; width:257px\" /><br /> Adalah 75,0%, dan dalam reaksi tersebut dikonsumsi sebanyak 45,0 g gas NO2, maka massa<br /> (dalam satuan gram) asam nitrat, <img alt=\"HNO_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?HNO_%7B3%7D\" />(aq) yang dihasilkan adalah<br />","choices":["22,5 g","30,8 g","41,1 g","54,8 g","69,3 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI1OQ"},{"id":"ODk-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu pil sakit kepala mengandung 200 mg ibuprofen <img alt=\"C_{13}H_{13}O_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B13%7DH_%7B13%7DO_%7B2%7D\" /> diminum dengan 0,5 L air oleh siswanya yang perutnya kosong. Bila semua pil tersebut larut, maka konsentrasi larutan (dalam satuan molal) yang terbentuk dalam perut siswa tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["2,3 x <img alt=\"10^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-3%7D\" /> m","4,1 x <img alt=\"10^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-3%7D\" /> m","9,7 x <img alt=\"10^{-4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-4%7D\" /> m","1,9 x <img alt=\"10^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-3%7D\" /> m","1,7 x <img alt=\"10^{-2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-2%7D\" /> m"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2MA"},{"id":"ODk-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada tekanan 50 kPa&nbsp;dan <img alt=\"127^{\\circ}C\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?127%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7DC\" />&nbsp;sebanyak 100 <img alt=\"cm^{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp;gas pada mempunyai massa 0,120 g. Massa molekul relatif gas tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["1,2","25","80","120","160"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2MQ"},{"id":"ODk-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui terdapat larutan zat dalam air sebagai berikut:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401160418.jpg\" style=\"height:21px; width:407px\" /><br /> Urutan yang paling tepat untuk kelarutan zat-zat tersebut di dalam air adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401160458.jpg\" style=\"height:97px; width:435px\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2Mg"},{"id":"ODk-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu zat padat mempunyai titik leleh yang tajam dan jelas di atas <img alt=\"100^{\\circ}C\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?100%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7DC\" />. Zat padat tersebut tidak dapat menghantarkan listrik bahkan dalam keadaan lelehan. Zat padat tersebut larut dalam pelarut hidrokarbon. Struktur yang paling tepat mengenai zat padat tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["Kristal atom","Kristal ion","Kristal molekul raksasa","Kristal molekul","Logam"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2Mw"},{"id":"ODk-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu sampel dari senyawa X, bila dipanaskan dengan larutan natrium hidroksida akan menghasilkan gas A. Bila X dipanaskan dalam asam sulfat pekat, akan dihasilkan gas B. Bila gasA dan B direaksikan, maka akan dihasilkan kembali senyawa X. Berdasarkan informasi tersebut maka senyawa X adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401161054.jpg\" style=\"height:98px; width:129px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2NA"},{"id":"ODk-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pernyataan paling tepat yang dapat menjelaskan bahwa endapan magnesium hidroksida dapat larut dalam larutan <img alt=\"NH_{4}Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DCl\" />(aq), tetapi tidak larut dalam larutan NaCl(aq) adalah<br />","choices":["Dalam air, larutan&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DCl\" />&nbsp;menghasilkan <img alt=\"NH_{4}OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DOH\" />&nbsp;dan ion OH yang terbentuk kemudian&nbsp;memberikan efek ion sejenis","&nbsp;Ion&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;dalam larutan&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DCl\" />&nbsp;akan menurunkan nilai hasil kali kelarutan&nbsp;<img alt=\"Mg_{4}OH_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Mg_%7B4%7DOH_%7B2%7D\" />","Larutan garam&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DCl\" />&nbsp;kurang berdisosiasi sempurna dibandingkan larutan NaCl","Ion&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"Mg_{2}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Mg_%7B2%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah isoelektron (mempunyai jumlah elektron sama)","Ion&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;dalam air akan menghasilkan sejumlah&nbsp;<img alt=\"H_{3}O^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B3%7DO%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2NQ"},{"id":"ODk-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Alanin.<img alt=\"H_{2}NCH(CH_{3})CO_{2}H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B2%7DNCH%28CH_%7B3%7D%29CO_%7B2%7DH\" />&nbsp;adalah suatu asam amino dengan nilai Ka =&nbsp;4,5 x <img alt=\"10^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-3%7D\" />&nbsp;7,4 x&nbsp;<img alt=\"10^{-5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-5%7D\" />.&nbsp;Di dalam air, spesi yang mempunyai konsentrasi paling tinggi pada pH 7 adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401181254.jpg\" style=\"height:89px; width:245px\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2Ng"},{"id":"ODk-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada molekul berikut ini.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401181406.jpg\" style=\"height:82px; width:162px\" /><br /> Jumlah atom karbon yang mempunyai hibridisasi&nbsp;<img alt=\"sp^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?sp%5E%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah","choices":["0","1","2","3","4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2Nw"},{"id":"ODk-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi pembentukan glukosa&nbsp;<img alt=\"(C_{6}H_{12}O_{6})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D%29\" />&nbsp;berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401182037.jpg\" style=\"height:20px; width:311px\" /><br /> Di antara pernyataan berikut yang paling tepat mengenai persen hasil&nbsp;<img alt=\"(C_{6}H_{12}O_{6})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D%29\" />&nbsp;adalah","choices":["Persen hasil <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" /> bertambah besar jika tekanan parsial <img alt=\"CO_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_%7B2%7D\" /> diturunkan","Persen hasil <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" /> naik dua kali lipat jika tekanan parsial <img alt=\"CO_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_%7B2%7D\" /> diduakalikan","Persen hasil <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" /> bertambah besar jika suhu dinaikkan","Persen hasil <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" /> berkurang jika suhu diturunkan","Persen hasil <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" /> berkurang jika bila tekanan total sistem reaksi dinaikkan"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2OA"},{"id":"ODk-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di dalam reaksi kimia perubahan senyawa X menjadi senyawa Z, melalui mekanisme reaksinya ditemukan bahwa tahap reaksinya berlangsung melalui pembentukan senyawa Y, yang dapat diisolasi. Tahap yang dilalui adalah:<br /> X --&gt; Y , ∆H = positif<br /> Y --&gt; Z , ∆H = negatif<br /> Berdasarkan informasi tersebut, profil reaksi yang sesuai dengan data tersebut adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401182424.jpg\" style=\"height:313px; width:361px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI2OQ"},{"id":"ODk-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi gas pencemar <img alt=\"NO_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_%7B2%7D\" /> dan ozon berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"2NO_{2}(g) + O_{3}(g) N_{2}O_{s}(g) + O_{2}(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2NO_%7B2%7D%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20O_%7B3%7D%28g%29%20N_%7B2%7DO_%7Bs%7D%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20O_%7B2%7D%28g%29\" /><br /> Reaksi tersebut diamati lajunya dan diperoleh data berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401184821.jpg\" style=\"height:77px; width:585px\" /><br /> Dari percobaan tersebut, penyataan paling tepat mengenai hukum laju reaksi (r) adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401190331.jpg\" style=\"height:86px; width:114px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3MA"},{"id":"ODk-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi berikut ini<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401193359.jpg\" style=\"height:17px; width:191px\" /><br /> telah disusulkan berlangsung melalui mekanisme berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401193525.jpg\" style=\"height:38px; width:367px\" /><br /> Hukum laju yang konsisten dengan mekanisme tersebut adalah:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401193641.jpg\" style=\"height:91px; width:453px\" /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3MQ"},{"id":"ODk-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi kesetimbangan berikut terjadi dalam campuran asam nitrat pekat dan asam sulfat pekat:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401194614.jpg\" style=\"height:18px; width:359px\" /><br /> Pernyataan yang paling tepat mengenai reaksi kesetimbangan ini adalah","choices":["Penambahan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\" /><img alt=\"H_{2}O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B2%7DO\" />&nbsp;akan mengurangi konsentrasi&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_{2}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_%7B2%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"HNO_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?HNO_%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_{2}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_%7B2%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah pasangan asam-basa konjugasi","Asam nitrat bertindak sebagai suatu oksidator","Asam sulfat bertindak sebagai dehidratator","Asam sulfat bertindak sebagai suatu basa"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3Mg"},{"id":"ODk-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tetapan kesetimbangan reaksi berikut ini masing-masing adalah <img alt=\"K_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7B1%7D\" />, <img alt=\"K_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7B2%7D\" />, dan <img alt=\"K_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp;<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401200306.jpg\" style=\"height:58px; width:351px\" /><br /> Tetapan kesetimbangan untuk reaksi di bawah ini adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401200506.jpg\" style=\"height:108px; width:332px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3Mw"},{"id":"ODk-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Setengah reaksi yang terjadi di anoda pada reaksi setara di bawah ini<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401200625.jpg\" style=\"height:22px; width:403px\" /><br /> Adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401200820.jpg\" style=\"height:88px; width:327px\" /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3NA"},{"id":"ODk-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan sel volta berikut ini<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200401200959.jpg\" style=\"height:201px; width:320px\" /><br /> Potensial sel volta ini,&nbsp;<img alt=\"E_{sel}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?E_%7Bsel%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["+0,0296","-0,0370 V","+0,0592 V","-0,399 V","0 V"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDI3NQ"},{"id":"ODk-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bentuk geometri, bilangan oksidasi, bilangan koordinasi tembaga, untuk ion kompleks.<br /><img alt=\"[Cu(NH_{3})4(OH_{2})_{2}]^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BCu%28NH_%7B3%7D%294%28OH_%7B2%7D%29_%7B2%7D%5D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["Tetrahedral ; +2 ; 6","Square planar ; -2 ; 4","Oktahedral ; +2 ; 6","Linier ; +3 ; 2","Trigonal Planar ; +1 ; 4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM3NQ"},{"id":"ODk-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Mengenai garam kompleks&nbsp;<img alt=\"[Cu(NH_{3})5Cl]Cl_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BCu%28NH_%7B3%7D%295Cl%5DCl_%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;,pernyataan yang tidak tepat adalah<br />","choices":["Larut dalam air","Dapat menghantarkan listrik","Larutan 1 mol&nbsp;<img alt=\"[Cu(NH_{3})5Cl]Cl_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BCu%28NH_%7B3%7D%295Cl%5DCl_%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;menghasilkan 1 mol kation dan 3 mol anion","Dalam air, kation kompleks yang terbentuk adalah&nbsp;<img alt=\"[Cu(NH_{3})5Cl]^{+2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BCu%28NH_%7B3%7D%295Cl%5D%5E%7B&amp;plus;2%7D\" />","Mengandung ligan <img alt=\"NH_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B3%7D\" /> DAN <img alt=\"Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Cl\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM3Ng"},{"id":"ODk-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini adalah asam-asam karboksilat<br /> I. <img alt=\"CHF_{2}CH_{2}CH_{2}CH_{2}CO_{2}H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CHF_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCO_%7B2%7DH\" /><br /> II. <img alt=\"CH_{3}CF_{2}CH_{2}CO_{2}H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_%7B3%7DCF_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCO_%7B2%7DH\" /><br /> III. <img alt=\"CH_{3}CH_{2}CH_{2}CO_{2}H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_%7B3%7DCH_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCO_%7B2%7DH\" /><br /> IV. <img alt=\"CH_{3}CH_{2}CH_{2}CO_{2}H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_%7B3%7DCH_%7B2%7DCH_%7B2%7DCO_%7B2%7DH\" /><br /> Dari keempat asam karboksilat tersebut, urutan yang paling tepat berdasarkan kenaikan keasaman, mulai dari yang paling asam hingga yang paling lemah asamnya, adalah<br />","choices":["I &gt; II &gt; III &gt; IV","I &gt; IV &gt; III &gt; II","III &gt; II &gt; I &gt; IV","III &gt; IV &gt; I &gt; II","IV &gt; I &gt; II &gt; III"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM3Nw"},{"id":"ODk-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara pernyataan mengenai senyawa berikut yang sesuai dengan aturan Huckle adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402103428.jpg\" style=\"height:94px; width:500px\" />","choices":["Naftalen bukan senyawa monosiklik, oleh karena itu bukan suatu senyawa aromatik","Pirol bukan senyawa hidrokarbon, dan bukan termasuk senyawa aromatik","Sikloheptatriena bukan senyawa konjugasi sempurna, yang bukan senyawa aromatik","Piridin merupakan basa lemah, dan juga bukan senyawa aromatik","Stirena mempunyai 8 &pi; elektron, dan juga bukan senyawa aromatik"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM3OA"},{"id":"ODk-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam reaksi adisi berikut ini,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402103656.jpg\" style=\"height:82px; width:293px\" />yang merupakan produk utama adalah:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402103816.jpg\" style=\"height:246px; width:461px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM3OQ"},{"id":"ODk-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa 2-bromobutana jika direaksikan dengan metanol, seperti pada persamaan reaksi berikut<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402103923.jpg\" style=\"height:81px; width:263px\" /><br /> Maka produk utama yang dihasilkan adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104015.jpg\" style=\"height:278px; width:389px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4MA"},{"id":"ODk-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan yang paling tepat berdasarkan kenaikan kereaktifan senyawa alkohol di bawah ini terhadap reaksi dehidrasi dalam suasana asam adalah:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104113.jpg\" style=\"height:118px; width:500px\" />","choices":["I &lt; II &lt; III","I &lt; III &lt; II","II &lt; III &lt; I","III &lt; I &lt; II","III &lt; II &lt; I"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4MQ"},{"id":"ODk-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa yang terbentuk dari reaksi kesetimbangan antara siklopentanon dengan HCN berikut<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104221.jpg\" style=\"height:120px; width:170px\" /><br /> Adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104323.jpg\" style=\"height:259px; width:461px\" /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4Mg"},{"id":"ODk-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan rangkaian reaksi berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104430.jpg\" style=\"height:104px; width:500px\" /><br /> Senyawa yang merupakan produk dari rangkaian reaksi di atas adalah :<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104528.jpg\" style=\"height:237px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4Mw"},{"id":"ODk-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Persamaan reaksi berikut ini adalah perubahan dari suatu alkena menjadi alkohol<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104626.jpg\" style=\"height:77px; width:500px\" /><br /> Pereaksi yang dipakai untuk reaksi perubahan tersebut adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104719.jpg\" style=\"height:107px; width:265px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4NA"},{"id":"ODk-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Produk dari reaksi Wittig di bawah ini adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104816.jpg\" style=\"height:254px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4NQ"},{"id":"ODk-q30","number":30,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Produk utama dari reaksi di bawah ini adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200402104917.jpg\" style=\"height:180px; width:357px\" />","choices":["p-cyano aniline","p-cyano nitro benzene","p-bromo cyano benzene","2-nitro-4-bromo cyanobenzene","2-cyano-4-bromo aniline"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDM4Ng"}]
